VALUES ('85fssN_8BIA','Iran: The taboo subject of sexual abuse of boys and dealing with trauma | DW Documentary','In Iran''s religious capital Qom, many restrictions dictate the freedom of women and girls to assure “sexual safety.” It was in this environment that Hossein was sexually assaulted as a young boy, a secret he carried into adulthood. Now, with the help of his wife Elahe, he is confronting his trauma. #documentary #dwdocumentary ______ DW Documentary gives you knowledge beyond the headlines. Watch top documentaries from German broadcasters and international production companies. Meet intriguing people, travel to distant lands, get a look behind the complexities of daily life and build a deeper understanding of current affairs and global events. Subscribe and explore the world around you with DW Documentary. Subscribe to: ⮞ DW Documentary (English): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocumentary ⮞ DW Documental (Spanish): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocumental ⮞ DW Documentary وثائقية دي دبليو (Arabic): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocarabia ⮞ DW Doku (German): https://www.youtube.com/dwdoku ⮞ DW Documentary हिन्दी (Hindi): https://www.youtube.com/dwdochindi For more visit: http://www.dw.com/en/tv/docfilm/s-3610 Follow DW Documentary on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/dwdocumentary/ Follow DW Documental on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/dwdocumental We kindly ask viewers to read and stick to the DW netiquette policy on our channel: https://p.dw.com/p/MF1G','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/85fssN_8BIA/maxresdefault.jpg','Documentaries','DW Documentary','DW Documentary','UCW39zufHfsuGgpLviKh297Q','DOCUMENTARY','2023-12-22T17:00:07Z','','','{"id":"85fssN_8BIA","title":"Iran: The taboo subject of sexual abuse of boys and dealing with trauma | DW Documentary","description":"In Iran''s religious capital Qom, many restrictions dictate the freedom of women and girls to assure “sexual safety.” It was in this environment that Hossein was sexually assaulted as a young boy, a secret